=== Verbs ===
Inflectional schema for verbs
==== English ====
English verbs may have 5 different simple forms: infinitive, third person singular indicative, simple past, past participle and gerund.<br />
INF<br />
3PS&PRS&IND<br />
PAS<br />
PTP<br />
GER<br />
